k out our space</h2></div></div><div class="virtual-tour_embed"><div class="virtual-tour_code_embed w-embed w-iframe"><iframe width="100%" height="600" allow="autoplay; gyroscope; accelerometer" src="https://livetour.istaging.com/e977dd21-757a-406f-9d3b-e117d0c55fcc" frameborder="0" webkitallowfullscreen mozallowfullscreen allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--spacer--variant="main" class="u-section-spacer w-variant-60a7ad7d-02b0-6682-95a5-2218e6fd1490 u-ignore-trim"></div></section><section id="" class="home-carousel_wrap u-section"><div data-wf--spacer--variant="none" class="u-section-spacer u-ignore-trim"></div><div class="home-carousel_contain"><div class="home-carousel_component"><div class="home-slider_cms_wrap swiper w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="home-slider_cms_list swiper-wrapper w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="home-slider_cms_item swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" STYLE="" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28 u-cover-absolute u-zindex-0 is-desktop"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d34162c496bedfc8fe04fd/69d46b2300b2c82fa8087f9c_celavi-tw_fullscreen-slider_home_1.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="u-image"/></div><div data-wf--media-overlay--variant="base" data-number="50" class="u-overlay"></div><div class="home-slide_content"><div class="home-slide_title"><h2 class="home-slider_title_text u-text-style-h3">Your Pursuit of Pleasure Begins Here</h2></div><div class="home-slide_description"><div data-number="60" data-wf--typography-paragraph--variant="inherit" class="u-text u-rich-text w-richtext u-margin-bottom-0"><p>Experience the magnificent sweeping views of vibrant Taipei.</p></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="home-slider_cms_item swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" STYLE="" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28 u-cover-absolute u-zindex-0 is-desktop"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d34162c496bedfc8fe04fd/69d46b104c2a0adc2ab1ebd6_celavi-tw_fullscreen-slider_home_2.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="u-image"/></div><div data-wf--media-overlay--variant="base" data-number="50" class="u-overlay"></div><div class="home-slide_content"><div class="home-slide_title"><h2 class="home-slider_title_text u-text-style-h3">A Playful Interpretation of Contemporary Asian Cuisine</h2></div><div class="home-slide_description"><div data-number="60" data-wf--typography-paragraph--variant="inherit" class="u-text u-rich-text w-richtext u-margin-bottom-0"><p>Elegant creations with theatrical flair that satisfy all the senses.</p></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="home-slider_cms_item swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" STYLE="" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28 u-cover-absolute u-zindex-0 is-desktop"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d34162c496bedfc8fe04fd/69d46b32f095266f0aa7266f_celavi-tw_fullscreen-slider_home_3.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="u-image"/></div><div data-wf--media-overlay--variant="base" data-number="50" class="u-overlay"></div><div class="home-slide_content"><div class="home-slide_title"><h2 class="home-slider_title_text u-text-style-h3">Sky&#x27;s The Limit</h2></div><div class="home-slide_description"><div data-number="60" data-wf--typography-paragraph--variant="inherit" class="u-text u-rich-text w-richtext u-margin-bottom-0"><p>Experience mixology that stirs the spirit of Asia, with concoctions unique to the region.</p></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="home-slider_cms_item swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" STYLE="" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28 u-cover-absolute u-zindex-0 is-desktop"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d34162c496bedfc8fe04fd/69d46b5421d1edf3268843ba_celavi-tw_fullscreen-slider_home_4.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="u-image"/></div><div data-wf--media-overlay--variant="base" data-number="50" class="u-overlay"></div><div class="home-slide_content"><div class="home-slide_title"><h2 class="home-slider_title_text u-text-style-h3">Light Up The Night at The Lounge</h2></div><div class="home-slide_description"><div data-number="60" data-wf--typography-paragraph--variant="inherit" class="u-text u-rich-text w-richtext u-margin-bottom-0"><p>Revel in the most current beats from resident and internationally renowned guest DJs.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="home-slider_layout"><div class="home-slider_bullet_wrap"><div class="home-slider_bullet_item is-active"></div><div class="home-slider_bullet_item"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--spacer--variant="none" class="u-section-spacer u-ignore-trim"></div><div class="u-embed-js w-embed w-script"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/swiper@12/swiper-bundle.min.css"/>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/swiper@12/swiper-bundle.min.js"></script>
<script>
document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
  document.querySelectorAll(".home-carousel_component").forEach((component) => {
    const cmsWrap = component.querySelector(".swiper");
    if (!cmsWrap) return;

    const swiper = new Swiper(cmsWrap, {
      loop: true,
      slidesPerView: "auto",
      followFinger: true,
      freeMode: false,
      slideToClickedSlide: false,
      centeredSlides: false,
      autoHeight: false,
      simulateTouch: false,
      autoplay: {
        delay: 6000,
        pauseOnMouseEnter: true,
        disableOnInteraction: false,
      },
      speed: 800,
      effect: 'fade',
      fadeEffect: {
        crossFade: true
      },
      slideActiveClass: "is-active",
      slideDuplicateActiveClass: "is-active",
      keyboard: {
        enabled: true,
        onlyInViewport: true,
      },
      pagination: {
        el: component.querySelector(".home-slider_bullet_wrap"),
        bulletActiveClass: "is-active",
        bulletClass: "home-slider_bullet_item",
        bulletElement: "button",
        clickable: true,
      },
    });
    
    const links = component.querySelectorAll('.home-slide_link');
    
    links.forEach(link => {
      link.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        e.stopPropagation();
        
        const url = link.getAttribute('href');
        if (url && url !== '#') {
          window.location.href = url;
        }
      }, true); 
    });
  });
});
</script></div><div class="u-embed-css w-embed"><style>
  .home-slider_cms_item {
    pointer-events: none !important;
    z-index: 1 !important;
  }

  .home-slider_cms_item.is-active {
    pointer-events: auto !important;
    z-index: 10 !important;
  }
</style></div></section><section id="welcome" data-view-wrapper="true" data-storage-key="events-view" class="events_wrap u-section"><div data-wf--spacer--variant="small" class="u-section-spacer w-variant-d422cbd0-f212-c815-68df-63414354c21d u-ignore-trim"></div><div class="events_contain u-container"><div class="events_layout"><div class="events_main_title_wrap"><div data-number="20" data-wf--typography-heading--variant="h5" class="u-heading w-variant-326a9562-3263-06da-e8ef-16981fd70f1c w-richtext u-alignment-center u-margin-bottom-3"><h3>What&#x27;s On</h3></div><div data-number="20" data-wf--typography-heading--variant="h3" class="u-heading w-variant-701c4b6c-37cf-de59-d80d-80a1822c4994 w-richtext u-alignment-center u-color-red"><h2>Happenings</h2></div></div><div class="events_clw w-dyn-list"><div data-view-element="true" role="list" class="events_cl w-dyn-items"><div data-view-element="true" role="listitem" class="events_ci w-dyn-item"><a data-view-image="true" data-view-element="true" href="/events/beyond-night" class="events_image w-inline-block"><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" STYLE="" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28 u-radius-main"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d34162c496bedfc8fe04fd/6ac37e96ee73a9a56799be7e_1080x1080%20CE%20LA%20VI.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="u-image"/></div></a><div data-view-text="true" data-view-element="true" class="events_description"><div data-view-element="true" class="events_details"><div class="events_day u-color-red u-text-transform-uppercase u-letter-spacing-medium">FRI 16 OCT</div><div data-view-element="true" class="events_location_wrap"><div class="events_location u-text-transform-uppercase u-letter-spacing-medium u-weight-medium is-1st">Boon</div><div class="events_location u-text-transform-uppercase u-letter-spacing-medium u-weight-medium">Club Lounge</div></div></div><h4 class="events_name u-color-rouge u-weight-regular">BEYOND NIGHT</h4><p class="events_card_subtitle">This October 16, DJ ASTO 🇵🇪 lands in Taipei for a special stop of his Asia Tour. One of the biggest names in the Latin scene, bringing his sound and energy to BOON by CÉ LA VI together with BEYOND</p><a href="/events/beyond-night" class="events_more_button u-text-transform-uppercase">More</a><div data-wf--button-main--variant="brand" data-button=" " data-trigger="hover focus" class="button_main_wrap"><div class="clickable_wrap u-cover-absolute"><a aria-label="Book Now" target="_blank" href="https://beyondproject.co/events/asto-october-16-celavi-taipei-taipei-oct-16?utm_source=ig&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_content=link_in_bio&amp;fbclid=PAZXh0bgNhZW0CMTEAcGRvZgJzcnRjBmFwcF9pZA85MzY2MTk3NDMzOTI0NTkAAaemEn1EFPVxDD2voPdbnpCprMak2MQV0iC5MPkgCslDTHtPVOPmJwb8U-gkVQ_aem_a-5GqIgDlHRnE4XoNIE2cA&amp;shpxid=9e612eeb-29e2-423c-8e4b-bec8a694af67" class="clickable_link w-inline-block"></a></div><div class="button_main_element w-variant-fe9d0c66-6606-d744-bc8a-d5cc192c8f75"><div aria-hidden="true" class="button_main_text u-text-style-small u-text-transform-uppercase u-letter-spacing-medium">Book Now</div><div class="button_main_icon u-hide-if-empty"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-view-element="true" role="listitem" class="events_ci w-dyn-item"><a data-view-image="true" data-view-element="true" href="/events/ce-la-vi-halloween-party-2026" class="events_image w-inline-block"><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" STYLE="" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28 u-radius-main"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d34162c496bedfc8fe04fd/6acf51cc2e32e82ee746e021_clv_taipei_halloween.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="u-image"/></div></a><div data-view-text="true" data-view-element="true" class="events_description"><div data-view-element="true" class="events_details"><div class="events_day u-color-red u-text-transform-uppercase u-letter-spacing-medium">FRI &amp; SAT | 30 &amp; 31 OCT</div><div data-view-element="true" class="events_location_wrap"><div class="events_location u-text-transform-uppercase u-letter-spacing-medium u-weight-medium is-1st">Boon</div><div class="events_location u-text-transform-uppercase u-letter-spacing-medium u-weight-medium">Club Lounge</div></div></div><h4 class="events_name u-color-rouge u-weight-regular">LABORATORY 🧪 CÉ LA VI HALLOWEEN PARTY 2026</h4><p class="events_card_subtitle">The experiment is about to begin. Are you ready? This Halloween, CÉ LA VI Taipei transforms into a mysterious laboratory, where the line between sanity and madness disappears.</p><a href="/events/ce-la-vi-halloween-party-2026" class="events_more_button u-text-transform-uppercase">More</a></div></div><div data-view-element="true" role="listitem" class="events_ci w-dyn-item"><a data-view-image="true" data-view-element="true" href="/events/combo-open-format" class="events_image w-inline-block"><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" STYLE="" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28 u-radius-main"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d34162c496bedfc8fe04fd/6acf5332466356690d744bc9_clv_taipei_combo_open_Format.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="u-image"/></div></a><div data-view-text="true" data-view-element="true" class="events_description"><div data-view-element="true" class="events_details"><div class="events_day u-color-red u-text-transform-uppercase u-letter-spacing-medium">SAT 14 NOV</div><div data-view-element="true" class="events_location_wrap"><div class="events_location u-text-transform-uppercase u-letter-spacing-medium u-weight-medium is-1st">Boon</div><div class="events_location u-text-transform-uppercase u-letter-spacing-medium u-weight-medium">Club Lounge</div></div></div><h4 class="events_name u-color-rouge u-weight-regular">🎮 COMBO｜OPEN FORMAT</h4><p class="events_card_subtitle">No genre limits. Non-stop energy. ⚡ Different genres. Seamless transitions. Inspired by the combo system in video games, COMBO breaks musical boundaries, bringing different sounds together, one track after another, building unstoppable energy on the dance floor!</p><a href="/events/combo-open-format" class="events_more_button u-text-transform-uppercase">More</a></div></div><div data-view-element="true" role="listitem" class="events_ci w-dyn-item"><a data-view-image="true" data-view-element="true" href="/events/2027-ce-la-vi-taipei-new-years-eve-party" class="events_image w-inline-block"><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" STYLE="" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28 u-radius-main"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d34162c496bedfc8fe04fd/6abb3df205f787b1610af807_KV.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="u-image"/></div></a><div data-view-text="true" data-view-element="true" class="events_description"><div data-view-element="true" class="events_details"><div class="events_day u-color-red u-text-transform-uppercase u-letter-spacing-medium">THU 31 DEC</div><div data-view-element="true" class="events_location_wrap"><div class="events_location u-text-transform-uppercase u-letter-spacing-medium u-weight-medium is-1st">Boon</div><div class="events_location u-text-transform-uppercase u-letter-spacing-medium u-weight-medium">Club Lounge</div></div></div><h4 class="events_name u-color-rouge u-weight-regular">2027 STARTS HERE 🥂🎆 | CÉ LA VI Taipei – CROSS OVER TAIPEI New Year’s Eve Party</h4><p class="events_card_subtitle">Start the New Year at CÉ LA VI Taipei! From 48 floors above the city, directly facing TAIPEI 101, this New Year’s Eve, watch the fireworks everyone’s been waiting for from one of the best seats in Taipei.</p><a href="/events/2027-ce-la-vi-taipei-new-years-eve-party" class="events_more_button u-text-transform-uppercase">More</a><div data-wf--button-main--variant="brand" data-button=" " data-trigger="hover focus" class="button_main_wrap"><div class="clickable_wrap u-cover-absolute"><a aria-label="Book Now" target="_blank" href="https://www.klook.com/zh-TW/activity/133103" class="clickable_link w-inline-block"></a></div><div class="button_main_element w-variant-fe9d0c66-6606-d744-bc8a-d5cc192c8f75"><div aria-hidden="true" class="button_main_text u-text-style-small u-text-transform-uppercase u-letter-spacing-medium">Book Now</div><div class="button_main_icon u-hide-if-empty"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-view-element="true" role="listitem" class="events_ci w-dyn-item"><a data-view-image="true" data-view-element="true" href="/events/happy-hour-hamburger" class="events_image w-inline-block"><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" STYLE="" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28 u-radius-main"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d34162c496bedfc8fe04fd/69f04fc4e847aea20d68ec1a_69de1b0174a6f2b1892ccb83_KV%20copy.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="u-image"/></div></a><div data-view-text="true" data-view-element="true" class="events_description"><div data-view-element="true" class="events_details"><div class="events_day u-color-red u-text-transform-uppercase u-letter-spacing-medium">TUE - FRI</div><div data-view-element="true" class="events_location_wrap"><div class="events_location u-text-transform-uppercase u-letter-spacing-medium u-weight-medium is-1st">Boon</div></div></div><h4 class="events_name u-color-rouge u-weight-regular">Happy Hour Hamburger</h4><p class="events_card_subtitle">Let burgers take over your afternoon!</p><a href="/events/happy-hour-hamburger" class="events_more_button u-text-transform-uppercase">More</a><div data-wf--button-main--variant="brand" data-button=" " data-trigger="hover focus" class="button_main_wrap"><div class="clickable_wrap u-cover-absolute"><a aria-label="Book Now" target="_blank" href="tel:0909-956-000" class="clickable_link w-inline-block"></a></div><div class="button_main_element w-variant-fe9d0c66-6606-d744-bc8a-d5cc192c8f75"><div aria-hidden="true" class="button_main_text u-text-style-small u-text-transform-uppercase u-let